                          <android.widget.TextView index="1" package="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01" class="android.widget.TextView" text="【Through the Gale】&#10;A drenched courier collapses through the lighthouse threshold just as the keeper bolts the door against the howling blizzard.&#10;&#10;【Fading Generator】&#10;The keeper and courier struggle to restart a sputtering generator together before freezing temperatures overtake the tower.&#10;&#10;【Shared Warmth】&#10;Huddled beside the restored stove, the courier questions the keeper's self-imposed exile while bandaging her bruised hand.&#10;&#10;【Unspoken Shift】&#10;As the storm rages outside, a quiet moment of physical closeness across the navigation table brings their unspoken attraction to the surface.&#10;&#10;【Static Dispatch】&#10;The emergency radio broadcasts an urgent alert tracing the courier's priority satchel back to a harbor incident the keeper fled years ago.&#10;&#10;【The Broken Lock】&#10;With dawn breaking and the stairway blocked, the courier begins breaking the satchel's seal under the keeper's watch.&#10;&#10;Possible Characters:&#10;• Thomas Vance — Lighthouse keeper guarding a solitary coastal watchtower&#10;• Nora Ellis — Coastal courier stranded during an emergency maritime transit" resource-id="com.cyberlink.powerdirector.DRA140225_01:id/text_mini_drama_outline_card_body" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="true" focused="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" scrollable="false" selected="false" bounds="[90,88][990,1017]" displayed="true" a11y-important="true" screen-reader-focusable="false" drawing-order="2" showing-hint="false" text-entry-key="false" dismissable="false" a11y-focused="false" heading="false" live-region="0" context-clickable="false" content-invalid="false" window-id="198" />
